"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[9372],{39372:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"ssha-otlozhili-poshliny-pokupatelyam-rossiyskoy-nefti","locale":"en","title":"US postpones tariffs on Russian-oil buyers as stocks gain 4.5% in a week","description":"The US suspended tariffs of up to 100% on the largest buyers of Russian oil and gas. How secondary tariffs work and what the pause means for Russia.","blocks":[{"id":"b001","kind":"paragraph","text":"On September 18, US President Donald Trump signed Russia sanctions legislation promoted by Senator Lindsey Graham. It authorized tariffs of up to 100% on all goods imported into the US from the 5 largest buyers of Russian oil and gas. The measures were due to take effect on October 18. Trump signed an order suspending them 2 days before that. The law permits this if the president tells Congress the measures conflict with US interests."},{"id":"b002","kind":"paragraph","text":"Secretary of State Marco Rubio gave two reasons for the pause. The administration does not want to disrupt negotiations with Russia and Ukraine, and will spend 60 days assessing the tariffs\' global economic impact. They would hit India and China while oil is already scarce because of disruptions in the Strait of Hormuz. Brent reached $110 per barrel on October 16, its highest since May. Analysts also connect the pause to congressional elections on November 3: expensive US fuel hurts voters."},{"id":"b003","kind":"paragraph","text":"Imagine a market whose management fines anyone buying vegetables from one farmer. The buyer pays the fine, but the farmer loses too. To retain customers, the farmer must reduce prices or find buyers unafraid of the penalty. Secondary tariffs work similarly. China bought about 9.1 billion euros of Russian oil, gas and coal in September, and India 4.1 billion. A tariff of up to 100% on all their US exports would force them to choose between Russian oil and the American market or demand a larger discount."},{"id":"b004","kind":"paragraph","text":"The discount to world prices determines Russia\'s revenue per barrel. Urals averaged $92.08 per barrel in September. India is already shifting suppliers: Russian oil\'s import share fell from 51% in July to 44% in August, with purchases moving toward the US and UAE. The pause removes the threat of buyers leaving or demanding bigger discounts, but only temporarily."},{"id":"b005","kind":"paragraph","text":"Investors saw the pause as an opportunity for sanctions relief, while expensive oil also supported stocks. The Moscow Exchange index gained 4.51% from October 12 to 16, reaching 2426 points. During weekend trading on Sunday, October 18, it approached 2450, a 3-month high. The ruble strengthened more modestly: the official dollar rate for October 17–19 was 83.62 rubles, versus 84.90 a week earlier. Brent fell by 2% to $107.6 on the morning of October 19 as markets anticipated more Russian fuel supply."},{"id":"b006","kind":"paragraph","text":"The order does not repeal the law. The president can restore tariffs at any time; a final decision is expected after the November 3 elections and December\'s G20 summit in Miami. Abandoning tariffs would preserve current buyers and discounts. Introducing them would make India and China reassess purchases, putting pressure on export revenue and the budget. Much of the week\'s stock rally reflects hope for the first outcome, which has not been secured."},{"id":"b007","kind":"heading","text":"Which tariffs on Russian-oil buyers did the US postpone?"},{"id":"b008","kind":"paragraph","text":"The law signed on September 18, 2026, authorized tariffs from October 18 of up to 100% on all goods imported into the US from the 5 largest buyers of Russian oil and gas. On October 16, the US president suspended the measures by executive order."},{"id":"b009","kind":"heading","text":"How do tariffs on India and China affect Russia?"},{"id":"b010","kind":"paragraph","text":"Buyers must choose between Russian oil and access to the US market for their goods. Sellers lower prices to retain customers. For Russia, that means a larger discount to world prices and less revenue per barrel."},{"id":"b011","kind":"heading","text":"When will the US make its final decision?"},{"id":"b012","kind":"paragraph","text":"Secretary of State Marco Rubio gave a period of up to 60 days. A decision is expected after the November 3 US congressional elections and December\'s G20 summit in Miami. The order does not repeal the law, and the president can restore tariffs at any time."}],"sources":[{"label":"Trump Signs Order Exempting Russia From New Sanctions Legislation","url":"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/10/17/trump-signs-order-exempting-russia-from-new-sanctions-legislation-a94012"},{"label":"Trump Suspends Russia-Linked Tariffs, Offering Relief To India","url":"https://www.outlookindia.com/international/trump-suspends-russia-linked-tariffs-india-russian-oil"},{"label":"What Trump\'s Waiver of New Russia Sanctions Means for Ukraine","url":"https://time.com/article/2026/10/17/what-trump-s-waiver-of-new-russia-sanctions-means-for-ukraine/"},{"label":"Trump postpones sweeping sanctions","url":"https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/9041600"},{"label":"Oil slips from 5-month high as Trump\'s Russia sanctions waiver may bring more supplies","url":"https://www.brecorder.com/news/40444883/oil-slips-from-5-month-high-as-trumps-russia-sanctions-waiver-may-bring-more-supplies"},{"label":"September 2026 — Monthly analysis of Russian fossil fuel exports and sanctions","url":"https://energyandcleanair.org/september-2026-monthly-analysis-of-russian-fossil-fuel-exports-and-sanctions/"},{"label":"Russian oil becomes almost one-and-a-half times more expensive","url":"https://lenta.ru/news/2026/10/05/urals/"},{"label":"Moscow Exchange index gains 25% over three months","url":"https://www.vbr.ru/novosti/investicii/2026/10/19/indeks-mosbirji-pribavil-25-za-tri-mesyaca/"},{"label":"Central bank lowers the October 17–19 dollar rate to 83.62 rubles","url":"https://finance.rambler.ru/economics/57237637-tsb-ponizil-kurs-dollara-na-17-19-oktyabrya-do-83-62-rublya/"},{"label":"US dollar exchange rate for October 10, 2026","url":"https://ppt.ru/currencies/usd/10-10-2026"}],"sourceBodySha256":"08a9ef35b4b6638b9180eb959dc7416a99027fabfd65ad99f9ce3dbcf52878d0"}')}}]);